  "fb": "A wrong-size return is often a customer who still wants the shoe.\n\nThis flow checks stock one size up or down and offers a swap before a refund, holds the pair for 48 hours, and only refunds if the customer chooses it.\n\nWant it mapped for your store? Message us REVIEW.",
