  "fb": "What actually happens in a KYC check? Our Identixa platform reads the ID with OCR, matches a selfie to the ID photo, screens the name against watchlists, sends edge cases to a human review dashboard, and returns the result through one API.\n\nNeed identity checks in your product? xenovasolutions.com/contact",
  "ig": "What actually happens in a KYC check? Here is how we built Identixa, our identity verification platform:\n\n01 OCR reads the ID document\n02 Face matching compares a selfie with the ID photo\n03 AML screening checks watchlists\n04 Edge cases go to a human review dashboard\n05 One REST API returns the result, with an audit trail\n\nIf your product needs identity checks, planning them in from the start saves rework later. Link in bio.\n\n#kyc #identityverification #fintech #ai #ocr #startups",
  "li": "Identity verification looks like one step to a user. Underneath, it's several.\n\nHow we built Identixa, our identity verification platform:\n→ OCR extracts the document details\n→ Face matching compares a selfie with the ID photo\n→ AML screening checks watchlists\n→ Low scores and possible matches go to a human review dashboard\n→ A REST API returns the result with an audit trail\n\nThe design choice that matters most: automate the clear cases, keep people on the edge cases.\n\nPlanning KYC for a fintech or marketplace product? https://xenovasolutions.com/contact\n\n{hashtag|\\#|KYC} {hashtag|\\#|FinTech} {hashtag|\\#|IdentityVerification}",
